  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "command": ["sh", "-c", "echo 'Job completed successfully'"]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

I will apply this strategic merge patch.

After patching, I must wait for the Job to be created with a new successful Pod, and then verify the Job's final status and the Pod's status.

